n't you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_footsteps_woodfloor","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The shadowy figure on the other side of the bookshelf slowly reveals itself. It is a familiar face."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A woman with short curly hair and a mocking smile is holding the book that Anna had her eyes on. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The 1972 edition of \"Roadside Picnic\"."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Martha","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Never thought I'd see you here. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Almost thought this was a dream."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":37,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Martha","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Or rather, a nightmare."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Martha","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"But I suppose it's good that you came. Spares me the effort of tracking down Armin. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You are both still minors, so I transferred the money to your father."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":37,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are you talking about?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Martha","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't like owing people. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Especially people not on my side."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":37,"side":"lef