 it properly."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Martha","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh. Have you found it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Creep","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Martha feels the petite girl scrabbling around her, her clothes rustling lightly in the dark. Martha frowns."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":34,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Not yet."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whoosh. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Martha pulls out a pointer from her boiler suit."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_23S_Winter_Night","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_2022Saros_button","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"closeMask","raw":"关闭蒙版"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She fiddles with it for a bit, and a small beam of light shines from its tip."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":36,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...What's that?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Martha","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"An application of quasicrystals."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":36,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,-50"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anna","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are quasicrystals?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Laplace","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Martha","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Don't ever tell anyone you were my student."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Ange","expression":33,"side":"left","tags"